0:34.464">Her </span><span begin="00:34.464" end="00:34.664">fingers </span><span begin="00:34.664" end="00:34.915">on </span><span begin="00:34.915" end="00:35.115">the </span><span begin="00:35.115" end="00:35.465">trigger </span><span begin="00:35.465" end="00:35.668">if </span><span begin="00:35.668" end="00:36.119">anybody </span><span begin="00:36.119" end="00:36.619">gets </span><span begin="00:36.619" end="00:36.870">out </span><span begin="00:36.870" end="00:37.171">of </span><span begin="00:37.171" end="00:37.722">line</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.358" end="00:42.861"><span begin="00:40.358" end="00:40.908">There's </span><span begin="00:40.908" end="00:41.109">other </span><span begin="00:41.109" end="00:41.359">places </span><span begin="00:41.359" end="00:41.709">that </span><span begin="00:41.709" end="00:41.960">are </span><span begin="00:41.960" end="00:42.210">better </span><span begin="00:42.210" end="00:42.411">to </span><span begin="00:42.411" end="00:42.859">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.315" end="00:45.934"><span begin="00:43.315" end="00:43.865">But </span><span begin="00:43.865" end="00:44.064">I'm </span><span begin="00:44.064" end="00:44.264">addicted </span><span begin="00:44.264" end="00:44.565">to </span><span begin="00:44.565" end="00:44.815">the </span><span begin="00:44.815" end="00:45.115">red </span><span begin="00:45.115" end="00:45.481">Light </span><span begin="00:45.481" end="00:45.929">show</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.284" end="00:48.940"><span begin="00:46.284" end="00:46.785">Feel </span><span begin="00:46.785" end="00:46.985">like </span><span begin="00:46.985" end="00:47.185">a </span><span begin="00:47.185" end="00:47.435">king </span><span begin="00:47.435" end="00:47.685">and </span><span begin="00:47.685" end="00:47.887">she's </span><span begin="00:47.887" end="00:48.087">my </span><span begin="00:48.087" end="00:48.237">ace </span><span begin="00:48.237" end="00:48.437">in </span><span begin="00:48.437" end="00:48.640">the </span><span begin="00:48.640" end="00:48.931">hole</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.808" end="00:51.715"><span begin="00:48.808" end="00:49.358">And </span><span begin="00:49.358" end="00:49.558">I </span><span begin="00:49.558" end="00:49.761">can't </span><span begin="00:49.761" end="00:50.011">get </span><span begin="00:50.011" end="00:50.211">enough </span><span begin="00:50.211" end="00:50.461">of </span><span begin="00:50.461" end="00:50.711">the </span><span begin="00:50.711" end="00:51.114">things </span><span begin="00:51.114" end="00:51.364">that </span><span begin="00:51.364" end="00:51.464">she </span><span begin="00:51.464" end="00:51.715">does</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.716" end="00:55.637"><span begin="00:51.716" end="00:52.215">She's </span><span begin="00:52.215" end="00:52.416">gonna </span><span begin="00:52.416" end="00:52.716">be </span><span begin="00:52.716" end="00:53.673">my </span><span begin="00:53.673" end="00:55.232">Midnight </span><span begin="00:55.232" end="00:55.628">Queen</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.540" end="00:57.808"><span begin="00:55.540" end="00:56.090">Lock </span><span begin="00:56.090" end="00:56.239">and </span><span begin="00:56.239" end="00:56.490">load </span><span begin="00:56.490" end="00:56.740">and </span><span begin="00:56.740" end="00:56.990">I'm </span><span begin="00:56.990" end="00:57.204">ready </span><span begin="00:57.204" end="00:57.457">to </span><span begin="00:57.457" end="00:57.805">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.709" end="01:01.082"><span begin="00:57.709" end="00:58.158">She's </span><span begin="00:58.158" end="00:58.374">gonna </span><span begin="00:58.374" end="00:58.976">lick </span><span begin="00:58.976" end="00:59.677">my </span><span begin="01:00.050" end="01:01.200">pistol </span><span begin="01:01.200" end="01:01.400">clean </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.400" end="01:03.771"><span begin=